{"content":[{"c":["KERIOTH"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. Town in the Negev of Judah (",{"href":"?bref=Josh.15.25","r":"Josh.15.25","rawR":"Josh.15.25","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.15.25","value":"Josh.15.25"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jos 15:25"},"), called Kerioth-hezron. The Hebrew text understands Kerioth and Hezron to be separate towns, the latter being identical to Hazor (v ",{"href":"?bref=Josh.15.23","r":"Josh.15.23","rawR":"Josh.15.23","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.15.23","value":"Josh.15.23"}],"t":"ref","v":"23"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. Town in Moab (",{"href":"?bref=Jer.48.24,41","r":"Jer.48.24,41","rawR":"Jer.48.24,41","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Jer.48.24,41","value":"Jer.48.24,41"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jer 48:24, 41"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Amos.2.2","r":"Amos.2.2","rawR":"Amos.2.2","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Amos.2.2","value":"Amos.2.2"}],"t":"ref","v":"Am 2:2"},"). From the Moabite Stone, it can be located in the southwest tableland of Moab opposite Ataroth. It is not counted among the towns of Reuben and Gad (",{"href":"?bref=Num.34.1-29","r":"Num.34.1-29","rawR":"Num.34.1-29","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Num.34.1-29","value":"Num.34.1-29"}],"t":"ref","v":"Nm 34"},": ",{"href":"?bref=Josh.13.1-33","r":"Josh.13.1-33","rawR":"Josh.13.1-33","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.13.1-33","value":"Josh.13.1-33"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jos 13"},"); in other lists it is absent while Ar is mentioned (",{"href":"?bref=Isa.15.1-16.14","r":"Isa.15.1-16.14","rawR":"Isa.15.1-16.14","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Isa.15.1-16.14","value":"Isa.15.1-16.14"}],"t":"ref","v":"Is 15–16"},"), which leads scholars to equate Ar with Kerioth."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Kerioth","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Jos 15:25","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Josh.15.25","rawQueryValue":"Josh.15.25","sourceRefExact":"Josh.15.25"},{"anchorText":"23","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Josh.15.23","rawQueryValue":"Josh.15.23","sourceRefExact":"Josh.15.23"},{"anchorText":"Jer 48:24, 41","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Jer.48.24,41","rawQueryValue":"Jer.48.24,41","sourceRefExact":"Jer.48.24,41"},{"anchorText":"Am 2:2","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Amos.2.2","rawQueryValue":"Amos.2.2","sourceRefExact":"Amos.2.2"},{"anchorText":"Nm 34","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Num.34.1-29","rawQueryValue":"Num.34.1-29","sourceRefExact":"Num.34.1-29"},{"anchorText":"Jos 13","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Josh.13.1-33","rawQueryValue":"Josh.13.1-33","sourceRefExact":"Josh.13.1-33"},{"anchorText":"Is 15–16","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Isa.15.1-16.14","rawQueryValue":"Isa.15.1-16.14","sourceRefExact":"Isa.15.1-16.14"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"e1b3bdcb15f82bef30691352a8350456720705f96e1924f9dde4d12fa281c990","sourceItemName":"Kerioth","sourceItemOrder":50,"sourceMember":"Articles/K.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Kerioth","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Kerioth","title":"Kerioth","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}